import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.HolomorphicPicardCechExtensionComparisonIso

/-!
# Reconstruction of a genuine extension from its local lifts

Actual degree-one lifts in a short exact sequence produce an overlap
cocycle. For any such supplied cocycle and lifts, the compatible-data
Čech extension is isomorphic to the original extension: local sections
are genuinely glued, the map is extended by actual sheafification,
and the short five lemma gives its inverse. Both endpoint maps are
literal identities, in both directions.
-/
